# The files allowlist in package.json is the primary boundary. These rules
# also protect files accidentally added under a published directory.
**/.env*
**/.npmrc
**/node_modules/**
**/data/**
**/logs/**
**/backups/**
**/reports/**
**/evaluations/**
**/workspace/**
**/.git/**
**/.codex*/**
**/.cursor/**
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.bak
**/*.tgz
**/*.zip
**/*.map
**/*~
